+<article class="plan featured"><span class="badge">MOST POPULAR</span><h2>Team</h2><p class="desc">Everything to keep a growing team in sync.</p><div class="price"><span class="amount" data-monthly="8" data-yearly="6.40">$8</span><span class="period">/ user / month</span></div><div class="billing-note" data-note> Billed monthly</div><hr><h3>Everything in Free, plus</h3><ul class="features"><li><span class="check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>Unlimited message history</li><li><span class="check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>Group calls and screen sharing</li><li><span class="check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>1 TB shared storage</li><li><span class="check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>Unlimited integrations</li><li><span class="check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>Priority support</li></ul><a class="cta" href="mailto:hello@relay.example?subject=Relay%20Team">Choose Team</a></article>
