+<section class="wrap section" id="compare" aria-labelledby="compare-title"><div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">Side by side</span><h2 id="compare-title">Find your fit</h2><p>The essentials, at a glance.</p></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Feature</th><th scope="col">Free</th><th scope="col">Team</th><th scope="col">Business</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Message history</th><td>90 days</td><td>Unlimited</td><td>Unlimited</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Members</th><td>Up to 10</td><td>Unlimited</td><td>Unlimited</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Shared storage</th><td>5 GB</td><td>1 TB</td><td>Unlimited</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Group calls</th><td>—</td><td>✓</td><td>✓</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Integrations</th><td>10</td><td>Unlimited</td><td>Unlimited</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Single sign-on</th><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>✓</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Priority support</th><td>—</td><td>✓</td><td>Dedicated</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
+<section class="wrap section faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title"><div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">Good to know</span><h2 id="faq-title">Frequently asked questions</h2></div><details><summary>Can I try Relay before paying?</summary><p>Absolutely. The Free plan is free forever, and you can explore Team features with a 14-day trial—no credit card required.</p></details><details><summary>How does yearly billing work?</summary><p>Choose yearly billing and save 20% compared with paying month to month. The displayed yearly price is the per-user monthly equivalent, billed annually.</p></details><details><summary>Can I change or cancel my plan?</summary><p>Yes. Upgrade, downgrade, or cancel at any time from your workspace settings. If you cancel a paid plan, access continues through the end of your billing period.</p></details><details><summary>What counts as a user?</summary><p>Each active member in your Relay workspace counts as one user. Guests with limited access are free.</p></details><details><summary>Do you offer help moving our team to Relay?</summary><p>We do. Our team can help import your conversations and get everyone settled in. Business customers also get a dedicated success manager.</p></details></section>
